{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b44bb3ab82bfedd76af2d0ab5731ed64f780f4f1eda150c1bd8fac8b90c28aa",
      "text": "……好，OK！\n起跳的镜头拍得非常完美哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2c0fae2935926fd7a3c941cbd1718161e0de0fa7976e71734a50a59ea6ae0aa",
      "text": "接下来只要在下一个场景也跳一下，\n把画面拼接起来就大功告成了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66e3f989b2c0c04b10c4ca86ece3022b8fb939b256608e12c9ce0c085669d07",
      "text": "谢谢大家的配合。一直以来我都想尝试一次呢，\n就是这种起跳后瞬间转移的镜头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea329b26fdd845b48654c07bb74fbc16fd9aca402115c2f702da4333d58da6f2",
      "text": "实先生！现在道谢可还太早啦！\n接下来可还有着陆环节呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fa276e1a7cf4a83d6be42f5c200edbbb1cbcf3a9d3384c6bbc31a77c74bbcdc",
      "text": "虽说曾见过熟人在电视上这么做，\n但真没想到自己也会有亲自尝试的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95821c5de98addf71a28eaafdaea3df205b89effaaa35ad52b491efeb6da8b13",
      "text": "应该是我向各位致谢才是。\n这是一次很有趣的体验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d69b9a79ac28aaa7c589d295847b0df001bcf80299af5dd27c34383380e3200",
      "text": "真想快点拍完下一场，看看拼接好的视频效果啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e6b03302294f4c1219bf358aa23e326df9cd4ab0d37a034eed528b2781e6e96",
      "text": "确实！话虽这么说，其实我心里更多的是\n为前半部分顺顺利利拍完而松了一口气啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466e3d539804217f5c939ed235081d644674e24e5b9cbe6aecf135f07f396737",
      "text": "各位，再次辛苦了。那么，\n大家最终选定的是什么样的企划呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c90a91488a5868d7a37482f25f2b580cc0ac536321434df8162cea75b8742e1e",
      "text": "对了对了。具体的企划内容，\n我们好像还没有跟●●●●プロデューサー详细说明过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf645c121b4e21dbed8b0bc0e7cc9a204b21c72aec8b23774fa256c6438d973",
      "text": "是的。因为需要提前确认拍摄所需的场地，\n所以希望能跟各位简单开个小会沟通一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df063fe19aadfcc3cbe3f414206a5c0d6960276c1e902715a1c0ccbd7f75a25",
      "text": "明白了。那就由我来向您说明吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000157:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000164:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0c376a4d52ca789655d1022f01989b5e3cb266ea3433a6ad44c931a3483c3e",
      "text": "各位，如果方便的话，\n在下次拍摄前，我们要不要\n聚在一起集训一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63e194ee508195030113783109a8c566b6bc2d173c557a8b8a591341355871c",
      "text": "哦，这主意不错啊！\n什么时候大家能聚齐？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f831ef4f1233fc3085b1c1d899e0d0a2e655e521d205b584238898fed9b0fa3",
      "text": "我也赞成。要是办集训的话，\n配合学生们的安排选在周末可能会比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184947e7cdf774f498881d0aa7db978423e848917f3b996d4fcfedc35699ec11",
      "text": "说的也是！\n大家这周末\n有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a51864fb57de11ce827ef7289b03f1459e3a5a5204bbe5b99b06a82599caac97",
      "text": "下周六的话我可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc65aa62e2266b22fdb236c04b0f7e83c110173a25f9bb7a1169b5af0dc8b1be",
      "text": "我周六也有空",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2dd12ae06021dea68ef118e52778d4cec5fd5cfb0e22c3eb7065dba0dd24cf3",
      "text": "那就这么定了吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>\n集训的内容菜单，\n能拜托给龙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc94d29f1da9c977a9918c46e08fa954649d63e91544bef956610c644ec1f5e",
      "text": "明白！\n就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3e1f3544f8ff43bfd55321c86370704d549c384e38714505de7137cdeab42d",
      "text": "哦哦太棒啦\n居然能让龙先生\n帮忙安排训练菜单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5f417276fb3ee83725a1811d7d2f5d6d6b99f203ab0b5757d1b3ed42a13365",
      "text": "那就拜托您了。\n我很期待当天的训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96d7bcae2dd865e2d343d0c6c722b19dfff15503458fe37269feac4139031d57",
      "text": "感觉会非常专业呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_14</emoji>\n为了不拖后腿，\n我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000186:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:681481fc4141c68f3d10d184d9e7abee1fb7b3fce0b0940db9325a4c3d02d7b5",
      "text": "放宽心啦！我会制定成\n像诚司先生在视频里示范过的\n新手训练菜单的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
